1
00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to Module 1. If you want to build a powerful RAG system, you'll need to start with a blueprint.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
In this module, you'll learn foundational RAG concepts, get familiar with a RAG system's main components,

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
and start building a functional RAG system. Here's what you can expect to see.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
First, you'll get a high-level introduction to RAG, including what it is, why you'd want to use it,

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
and how it can improve the quality of responses generated by a large language model.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Next, you'll get a closer look at the architecture of a RAG system.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
RAG pairs an LLM with a retriever, a component that can help the LLM find relevant information

8
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
in a knowledge base of trusted information. You'll do a deep dive on each component and then see how they work together.

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
RAG is useful in a wide variety of contexts, so then you'll see several examples of production RAG systems

10
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
and start reflecting on opportunities to use RAG in your own LLM-based projects.

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Throughout the module, you'll get hands-on with sample code, and at the end,

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
you'll complete your first programming assignment, implementing parts of a simple RAG system.

13
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Throughout the rest of the course, you'll expand on this first system, adding more complex features

14
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
like a robust retriever, a vector database, more sophisticated uses of an LLM,

15
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000
and a variety of techniques for monitoring and evaluation.

16
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.000
There's a lot of exciting topics awaiting you in this module, and it sets the roadmap

17
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.000
for what you'll learn throughout the entire course. Join me in the next video, and let's get started.

